  "title": "Easy Make-Ahead Green Bean Casserole",
  "description": "This make-ahead green bean casserole does not include cream of mushroom soup or french-fried onions, making it a nice break from the normal holiday recipes!",
  "authors": [
    "Katherine Duweck"
  ],
